you left your helmet behind.

263
00:21:03,741 --> 00:21:06,702
Sir, a helmet can interfere
with my psychic abilities.

264
00:21:08,120 --> 00:21:10,456
Think a bullet might
interfere with them more.

265
00:21:22,093 --> 00:21:23,302
Are you ready?

266
00:21:23,385 --> 00:21:24,512
Yes, sir.

267
00:21:26,347 --> 00:21:27,765
You don't look ready.

268
00:21:27,848 --> 00:21:29,517
Just adrenaline, sir.

269
00:22:48,012 --> 00:22:49,096
Rookie.

270
00:22:50,848 --> 00:22:52,474
