271
00:22:53,434 --> 00:22:55,769
Crime, possession and use
of controlled substances.

272
00:22:55,853 --> 00:22:57,938
Sentence: two years iso-cubes.

273
00:22:58,939 --> 00:23:00,858
No, don't tell me. Tell Control.

274
00:23:02,735 --> 00:23:03,861
Anderson to Control.

275
00:23:03,944 --> 00:23:04,987
<i>Copy.</i>

276
00:23:05,070 --> 00:23:07,364
Requesting meat wagon to
Peach Trees, level 39.

277
00:23:07,448 --> 00:23:08,657
We have

278
00:23:08,741 --> 00:23:12,328
four bodies for Resyk
and eight live for the iso-cubes.

279
00:23:12,411 --> 00:23:14,413
<i>Copy that. Meat wagon inbound.</i>

280
00:23:15,122 --> 00:23:16,957
All right. Let's get them cuffed.

281
00:23:17,458 --> 00:23:18,500
Move. Up.

282
00:23:25,799 --> 00:23:28,010
Sir, this one's a gang member. He...

283
00:23:35,100 --> 00:23:36,685
Sir, it's him.

284
00:23:36,769 --> 00:23:38,395
Him who?

285
00:23:38,479 --> 00:23:40,280
The man who murdered
the people in the atrium.

286
00:23:42,316 --> 00:23:43,317
You're sure?

287
00:23:46,278 --> 00:23:47,529
99%.

288
00:23:50,658 --> 00:23:53,285
Can't execute a perp on 99%.

289
00:23:57,831 --> 00:24:01,543
Save me a lot of paperwork
if you just confess right now.

290
00:24:05,005 --> 00:24:07,132
We'll take him in.

291
00:24:07,216 --> 00:24:10,094
See how he holds up
after a few hours of interrogation.

292
00:24:36,829 --> 00:24:38,038
Oh, shit.

293
00:24:39,832 --> 00:24:42,501
Judges. No, no, no...

294
00:24:45,004 --> 00:24:48,716
Uh, Caleb?
There's a problem on level 39.

295
00:24:49,049 --> 00:24:51,529
Judges hit the distribution point
and shot the place up.

296
00:24:51,593 --> 00:24:53,095
Took out a few of the boys.

297
00:24:53,178 --> 00:24:54,888
So what? We're overdue a bust.

298
00:24:55,055 --> 00:24:56,366
It's just the judges showing their faces,

299
00:24:56,390 --> 00:24:57,891
reminding the citizens they exist.

300
00:24:57,975 --> 00:24:59,852
No, Ma. They picked up Kay.

301
00:24:59,935 --> 00:25:00,978
Executed?

302
00:25:01,061 --> 00:25:03,355
Interrogation.
They're taking him in right now.

303
00:25:03,439 --> 00:25:04,440
Fuck.

304
00:25:04,982 --> 00:25:06,066
If Kay talks...

305
00:25:06,233 --> 00:25:08,527
If they're taking him in, he'll talk.

306
00:25:11,155 --> 00:25:12,406
What are we gonna do?

307
