That one's still breathing.

308
00:25:49,109 --> 00:25:50,569
Control room is secure.

309
00:25:58,118 --> 00:26:00,287
Router's in. You're good to go.

310
00:26:03,457 --> 00:26:04,917
<i>Sector Control.</i>

311
00:26:05,959 --> 00:26:08,045
Sector Control. This is
Peach Tree's control.

312
00:26:08,128 --> 00:26:09,773
I just wanna check you were notified about

313
00:26:09,797 --> 00:26:11,799
