314
00:26:11,882 --> 00:26:13,384
<i>Copy that.</i>

315
00:26:13,467 --> 00:26:15,528
<i>Peach Trees, we don't have
you down for a def-con test.</i>

316
00:26:15,552 --> 00:26:17,221
Yeah, we must be. If you check the...

317
00:26:17,304 --> 00:26:18,639
<i>I've got nothing.</i>

318
00:26:21,642 --> 00:26:23,435
God fucking damn it, Sector!

319
00:26:23,519 --> 00:26:26,855
I put in the notification
myself three fucking times!

320
00:26:27,147 --> 00:26:28,399
We are good to go right now!

321
00:26:28,482 --> 00:26:31,902
I've got my supervisor
breathing down my neck.

322
00:26:31,985 --> 00:26:34,321
<i>Hold fire, Peach Trees.
Let me get on this.</i>

323
00:26:34,988 --> 00:26:37,199
<i>Okay. I put you on the system.</i>

324
00:26:37,282 --> 00:26:39,326
<i>Hall of Justice and all emergency services</i>

325
00:26:39,410 --> 00:26:41,078
<i>are notified to ignore your status.</i>

326
00:26:41,161 --> 00:26:43,330
<i>You can run the test any time you like.</i>

327
00:26:43,497 --> 00:26:45,040
Appreciate that, Sector.

328
00:26:45,290 --> 00:26:47,334
You just saved my ass over here.

329
00:26:47,668 --> 00:26:49,169
<i>You're welcome, Peach Trees.</i>

330
00:26:59,012 --> 00:27:01,640
Sir, he's thinking about
making a move for your gun.

331
00:27:02,349 --> 00:27:03,517
Yeah.

332
00:27:04,685 --> 00:27:06,645
He just changed his mind.

333
00:27:07,146 --> 00:27:08,147
Yeah.

334
00:27:13,110 --> 00:27:14,778
<i>Then enter the pass key</i>

335
00:27:14,862 --> 00:27:16,321
<i>and you should be inside.</i>

336
00:27:18,866 --> 00:27:20,868
<i>Security protocols accessed.</i>

337
00:27:22,369 --> 00:27:24,163
<i>War protocol accessed.</i>

338
00:27:25,706 --> 00:27:27,499
<i>Blast shield initiated.</i>

339
00:27:33,172 --> 00:27:35,716
Warned you. Get up.
You're headed for the cubes.

340
00:27:35,799 --> 00:27:37,319
<i>Stand clear of doors.</i>

341
00:27:40,804 --> 00:27:43,015
<i>All residents remain calm.</i>

342
00:27:45,392 --> 00:27:47,478
<i>All residents remain calm.</i>

343
00:27:49,396 --> 00:27:51,106
<i>All residents remain calm.</i>

344
00:28:23,847 --> 00:28:25,098
What's going on?

345
00:28:34,024 --> 00:28:35,943
<i>Lockdown complete.</i>

346
00:28:48,747 --> 00:28:50,415
You're patched in.

347
00:29:06,306 --> 00:29:07,558
Peach Trees.

348
00:29:08,642 --> 00:29:09,977
<i>This is Ma-Ma.</i>

349
00:29:13,730 --> 00:29:16,233
<i>Somewhere in this block are two judges.</i>

350
00:29:18,819 --> 00:29:20,195
<i>I want them dead.</i>

351
00:29:22,281 --> 00:29:24,825
<i>Until I get what I want,
the block is locked down.</i>

352
00:29:27,327 --> 00:29:31,206
<i>All Clan, every level,
hunt the judges down.</i>

353
00:29:32,916 --> 00:29:34,751
Everyone else, clear the corridors

354
00:29:34,835 --> 00:29:37,421
and stay the fuck out of our way
until the shooting stops.

355
00:29:41,174 --> 00:29:42,884
<i>If I hear of anyone helping the judges,</i>

356
00:29:42,968 --> 00:29:46,179
<i>I will kill them and the next
generation of their family.</i>

357
00:29:53,020 --> 00:29:54,938
<i>As for the judges...</i>

358
00:29:55,022 --> 00:29:56,773
We better move.

359
00:29:56,857 --> 00:29:59,192
<i>...sit tight, or run.</i>

360
00:30:02,988 --> 00:30:05,198
Makes no difference. You're mine.

361
00:30:24,509 --> 00:30:25,802
Control, we have a situation

362
00:30:25,886 --> 00:30:27,888
