Do you copy?

363
00:30:29,890 --> 00:30:31,475
Control, do you copy?

364
00:30:31,558 --> 00:30:33,268
My comms are down too.

365
00:30:33,352 --> 00:30:35,228
Shielding must be blocking
our transmissions.

366
00:30:36,229 --> 00:30:37,981
We'll head for the Med Center.

367
00:30:43,028 --> 00:30:44,404
They're here!

368
00:30:45,989 --> 00:30:47,282
- Call it.
- Sir?

369
00:30:47,366 --> 00:30:49,201
You're on assessment, Rookie. Call it.

370
00:30:50,577 --> 00:30:52,221
Multiple armed targets.
Obstructed line of sight.

371
00:30:52,245 --> 00:30:53,747
- Gas grenades.
- Respirators.

372
00:30:55,832 --> 00:30:57,334
Advise you hold your breath.

373
00:31:56,893 --> 00:32:00,063
I want the North and East
corridor totally covered.

374
00:32:00,147 --> 00:32:01,898
Sal's got the West and the South.

375
00:32:02,315 --> 00:32:03,817
And spread out your hardware.

376
00:32:04,401 --> 00:32:07,154
We're gonna hand these judges
back to Ma-Ma on a plate.

377
00:32:11,825 --> 00:32:13,744
Stay fucking focused.

378
00:32:13,827 --> 00:32:15,829
Judges got it coming!

379
00:32:27,591 --> 00:32:29,111
Judge, come and get me.

380
00:32:29,176 --> 00:32:31,303
We're gonna have to go through them.

381
00:32:32,679 --> 00:32:34,264
Stun grenade.

382
00:32:38,310 --> 00:32:40,270
Kill that motherfucker.

383
00:32:40,353 --> 00:32:42,063
Let's give them the good news.

384
00:32:47,527 --> 00:32:49,780
Man up that corridor, man.

385
00:32:49,863 --> 00:32:51,072
Fuck up the judges.

386
00:32:51,156 --> 00:32:52,449
Fuck them.

387
00:32:52,532 --> 00:32:56,203
Citizens of Peach Trees. This is the law.

388
00:32:56,328 --> 00:32:58,205
Who do you think you are
coming up in here?

389
00:32:58,538 --> 00:32:59,998
Disperse immediately,

390
00:33:00,081 --> 00:33:02,918
