force to clear the area.

391
00:33:03,084 --> 00:33:04,211
Where's that coming from?

392
00:33:04,461 --> 00:33:06,505
Over there. Access corridor.

393
00:33:07,130 --> 00:33:09,216
<i>You have been warned.</i>

394
00:33:10,383 --> 00:33:13,053
You now have 20 seconds to comply.

395
00:33:13,470 --> 00:33:15,430
It's you doing the complying, Judge.

396
00:33:15,889 --> 00:33:18,141
There's 10 of us, only two of you.

397
00:33:19,059 --> 00:33:21,061
Why don't you step out
from behind that doorway

398
00:33:21,186 --> 00:33:22,663
or we're gonna blow the fuck out of you.

399
00:33:22,687 --> 00:33:24,356
Ten seconds to comply.

400
00:33:24,689 --> 00:33:26,900
- Fuck you, Judge.
- You got five.

401
00:33:27,734 --> 00:33:29,194
Thanks for the heads-up.

402
00:33:49,089 --> 00:33:50,215
Please.

403
00:33:51,424 --> 00:33:53,176
What are you waiting for, rookie?

404
00:33:53,552 --> 00:33:55,679
His crime is attempted murder of a Judge.

405
00:33:55,762 --> 00:33:57,472
His sentence is death.

406
00:33:59,766 --> 00:34:00,934
Yes, sir.

407
00:34:27,627 --> 00:34:28,962
Open up.

408
00:34:30,130 --> 00:34:31,256
<i>Open Up!</i>

409
00:34:32,716 --> 00:34:33,800
<i>Negative, Judge.</i>

410
00:34:33,967 --> 00:34:35,677
<i>You know what's going on out here.</i>

411
00:34:35,886 --> 00:34:37,345
We need a place we can defend.

412
00:34:37,429 --> 00:34:39,097
<i>Then you better find someplace else.</i>

413
00:34:39,180 --> 00:34:41,308
<i>This is a medical facility. Neutral ground.</i>

414
00:34:41,474 --> 00:34:44,978
Neutral? You're not neutral.
You're choosing sides.

415
00:34:45,312 --> 00:34:46,992
<i>Peach Trees has been sealed by blast doors</i>

416
00:34:47,022 --> 00:34:48,607
<i>designed to withstand attack.</i>

417
00:34:48,690 --> 00:34:50,901
<i>No one's getting out. No one's coming in.</i>

418
00:34:51,401 --> 00:34:54,487
<i>And you have every clan affiliate
in the block after your blood.</i>

419
00:34:55,447 --> 00:34:58,575
There are no sides. You're already dead.

420
00:35:19,179 --> 00:35:21,848
Looks like
the Med Center's closed early today.

421
00:35:22,349 --> 00:35:24,017
Switch weapon to silencer mode.

422
00:35:24,351 --> 00:35:26,353
Our best bet now is to go covert.

423
00:35:26,853 --> 00:35:28,355
Conserve ammunition.

424
00:35:28,855 --> 00:35:30,690
And don't shoot unless you're gonna hit.

425
00:35:33,276 --> 00:35:34,819
Sir, what about the prisoner?

426
00:35:35,445 --> 00:35:36,446
Explain.

427
00:35:36,863 --> 00:35:39,282
Under the circumstances,
he could be a liability.

428
00:35:39,616 --> 00:35:41,701
Also a prime suspect in three homicides.

429
00:35:44,037 --> 00:35:47,207
What do you say, rookie?
Wanna out him loose?

430
00:35:48,458 --> 00:35:49,542
No, sir.

431
00:36:02,013 --> 00:36:03,348
Get up!

432
00:36:23,618 --> 00:36:25,453
Go, go, go, go!

433
00:36:44,681 --> 00:36:45,807
Hold up.

434
00:37:00,613 --> 00:37:01,698
Move!

435
00:37:01,781 --> 00:37:03,616
Keep your eyes peeled.

436
00:37:03,700 --> 00:37:05,861
Man, stop telling me what to fucking do!

437
00:37:16,588 --> 00:37:18,631
I know that new shit...

438
00:37:26,181 --> 00:37:27,307
Cathy?

439
00:37:28,183 --> 00:37:30,268
<i>- Who's there?</i>
- Cathy, open the door.

440
00:37:37,650 --> 00:37:39,152
We're not gonna hurt you.

441
00:37:54,125 --> 00:37:55,126
Clear.

442
00:37:56,336 --> 00:37:58,456
Secure the woman somewhere
she can't raise any alarms.

443
00:37:59,798 --> 00:38:00,965
We can't.

444
00:38:02,092 --> 00:38:05,595
She has a baby. Asleep in the next room.

445
00:38:06,513 --> 00:38:08,741
We can't secure her if we don't know
when she'll be freed.

446
00:38:08,765 --> 00:38:10,266
Is there a father?

447
00:38:10,809 --> 00:38:13,061
He's out there. Looking for us.

448
00:38:15,688 --> 00:38:17,607
Say that. What you were just thinking.

449
00:38:18,149 --> 00:38:19,692
How did you...

450
00:38:19,776 --> 00:38:21,236
It's okay. Go ahead.

451
00:38:24,531 --> 00:38:26,533
I'm not raising any alarms.

452
00:38:27,033 --> 00:38:30,453
If the men out there don't know where
you are, you won't be killing them.

453
00:38:30,537 --> 00:38:31,538
Go on.

454
00:38:33,123 --> 00:38:35,041
There's a service elevator near here.

455
00:38:35,959 --> 00:38:38,211
The sign says it's broken, but

456
00:38:41,756 --> 00:38:44,884
it works as long as you're hitting
a button above level 75.

457
00:38:45,885 --> 00:38:49,013
I just want you off my level.
Away from my family.

458
00:39:21,546 --> 00:39:22,964
- Cathy, I...
- Don't thank me.

459
00:39:23,882 --> 00:39:27,677
It's not for you.
I just don't wanna see you again.

460
00:39:31,890 --> 00:39:33,057
You won't.

461
00:40:03,046 --> 00:40:05,882
<i>This drug shifts like
nothing I've ever seen.</i>

462
00:40:05,965 --> 00:40:08,801
<i>If we play this right,
we could take the whole fucking city.</i>

463
00:40:09,510 --> 00:40:11,930
The only danger is we expand too fast.

464
00:40:13,139 --> 00:40:16,100
In the last few days, we've added
distribution to three new blocks.

465
00:40:16,184 --> 00:40:20,271
And pretty soon, we're looking at
making inroads into Sectors 9 and 15.

466
00:40:20,355 --> 00:40:22,482
Fifteen is still Red territory.

467
00:40:24,609 --> 00:40:26,110
Ma, you better come quick.

468
00:40:27,820 --> 00:40:29,906
Okay. We got one here,

469
00:40:29,989 --> 00:40:32,575
maybe 11 outside the Med Center.

470
00:40:32,659 --> 00:40:35,995
There's eight in the stairwell
and another five on level 18.

471
00:40:36,079 --> 00:40:39,332
They've downed 30 plus
and haven't even taken a scratch.

472
00:40:39,999 --> 00:40:41,125
Where are they now?

473
