483
00:41:32,969 --> 00:41:34,345
Too late, Judge.

484
00:41:38,141 --> 00:41:39,559
Caleb, come in.

485
00:41:39,851 --> 00:41:41,060
<i>Ma.</i>

486
00:41:42,103 --> 00:41:43,438
