487
00:41:43,521 --> 00:41:45,356
We're taking them down right now.

488
00:41:52,989 --> 00:41:54,907
We'd need oxyacetylene to cut through.

489
00:41:55,408 --> 00:41:56,617
They know where we are.

490
00:41:56,701 --> 00:41:58,161
Why aren't they coming after us?

491
00:41:59,078 --> 00:42:00,747
That's what worries me.

492
00:42:05,251 --> 00:42:07,170
Take him back to the main lobby.

493
00:42:07,253 --> 00:42:09,255
Hold position behind the elevator shaft.

494
00:42:10,089 --> 00:42:11,299
Be a good place to defend.

495
