499
00:42:26,773 --> 00:42:27,774
Sir.

500
00:42:59,347 --> 00:43:01,057
Get away from the door!

501
00:43:10,775 --> 00:43:12,110
Sit down!

502
00:43:32,463 --> 00:43:34,006
He's right, you know.

503
00:43:35,383 --> 00:43:37,510
About not wanting to be taken alive.

504
00:43:39,470 --> 00:43:42,098
The stuff the Clan would do
to a girl like you...

505
00:43:45,434 --> 00:43:46,435
Nasty.

506
00:43:58,322 --> 00:44:01,284
We had a girl one time,
girl about your age and...

507
00:44:07,248 --> 00:44:09,000
Well, anyway...

508
00:44:10,710 --> 00:44:13,713
I'm just saying,
save the last bullet for yourself.

509
00:44:14,172 --> 00:44:16,174
Yeah, and I'll save
the second to last one for you.

510
00:44:16,716 --> 00:44:17,842
Sure.

511
00:44:22,013 --> 00:44:23,306
So you're a mutant?

512
00:44:24,724 --> 00:44:28,561
Most of you poor fuckers
got three stumpy arms, or no arms.

513
00:44:29,979 --> 00:44:35,067
But I guess you lucked out.
