778
01:11:50,451 --> 01:11:51,911
Where are you going?

779
01:11:51,994 --> 01:11:55,456
I've got the girl cold.
I see her first, I shoot her.

780
01:11:55,540 --> 01:11:57,792
She sees me first, she hesitates,

781
01:11:57,875 --> 01:11:59,544
then I shoot her.

782
01:13:33,012 --> 01:13:35,139
What's the price of a judge these days?

783
01:13:37,266 --> 01:13:38,601
Million.

784
01:13:43,856 --> 01:13:45,650
Split four ways.

785
01:13:50,571 --> 01:13:51,989
Three ways now.

786
01:13:53,199 --> 01:13:54,367
Suits me.

787
01:13:58,996 --> 01:14:00,665
Doesn't sound like much.

788
01:14:04,377 --> 01:14:05,628
To betray the law.

789
01:14:12,885 --> 01:14:14,512
Betray the city.

790
01:14:18,391 --> 01:14:20,184
Save that shit for the rookies.

791
01:14:21,435 --> 01:14:23,646
Twenty years I've been on the streets.

792
01:14:25,898 --> 01:14:28,567
You know what Mega City One is, Dredd?

793
01:14:30,027 --> 01:14:32,446
It's a fucking meat grinder.

794
01:14:33,239 --> 01:14:34,740
People go in one end.

795
01:14:41,789 --> 01:14:43,541
And meat comes out the other.

796
01:14:48,838 --> 01:14:50,589
All we do

797
01:14:51,340 --> 01:14:52,800
is turn the handle.

798
01:15:03,853 --> 01:15:04,895
Rapid fire.

799
01:15:06,814 --> 01:15:08,691
Incendiary. Armor piercing.

800
01:15:10,067 --> 01:15:11,318
High ex.

801
01:15:15,906 --> 01:15:17,283
Motherfucker.

802
01:15:22,038 --> 01:15:23,289
Two-way split.

803
01:15:23,956 --> 01:15:25,875
Yeah, I'd be breaking a sweat,

804
01:15:25,958 --> 01:15:27,585
if you hadn't just run out of bullets.

805
01:15:44,143 --> 01:15:46,604
Lower your gun, rookie. I'm your backup.

806
01:16:08,751 --> 01:16:10,002
Armor piercing.

807
01:16:45,871 --> 01:16:46,872
Wait.

808
01:16:49,875 --> 01:16:50,876
Wait?

809
01:16:52,503 --> 01:16:55,422
Are you kidding me?
Did you just say "wait"?

810
01:16:58,467 --> 01:17:00,052
Judge Dredd,

811
01:17:01,804 --> 01:17:03,722
the Judge Dredd

812
01:17:04,557 --> 01:17:07,393
finally gets on the wrong end of a gun,

813
01:17:07,518 --> 01:17:10,479
and what he says is "wait."

814
01:17:12,106 --> 01:17:15,860
You know what? I expected more of you.

815
01:17:16,569 --> 01:17:20,573
I mean, wait for what?
Wait for me to change my mind?

816
01:17:20,906 --> 01:17:22,551
Wait for another two or
three seconds of life

817
01:17:22,575 --> 01:17:24,285
because you're so fucking weak

818
01:17:24,368 --> 01:17:26,078
you can't stand to see it end?

819
01:17:27,246 --> 01:17:28,247
No.

820
01:17:35,963 --> 01:17:37,548
Wait for her to shoot you.

821
01:17:43,637 --> 01:17:44,889
Okay.

822
01:17:45,431 --> 01:17:47,016
Basic field dressing.

823
01:18:08,454 --> 01:18:09,788
Reload.

824
01:18:17,755 --> 01:18:18,756
Ready?

825
01:18:19,256 --> 01:18:20,341
Yeah.

826
01:18:21,133 --> 01:18:22,426
You look ready.

827
01:18:55,501 --> 01:18:58,963
No, don't shoot! Please don't shoot me!

828
01:18:59,046 --> 01:19:02,591
I'm not armed. I'm not armed.
I can help you.

829
01:19:02,675 --> 01:19:03,676
How?

830
01:19:04,426 --> 01:19:05,761
Ma-Ma's in her private quarters,

831
01:19:05,844 --> 01:19:08,889
but it's behind 10 inches of steel.

832
01:19:08,973 --> 01:19:11,267
So you can't get in there
without the keypad combination.

833
01:19:11,350 --> 01:19:13,310
I can give that to you.

834
01:19:14,603 --> 01:19:15,763
I don't need your cooperation

835
01:19:15,771 --> 01:19:17,606
to get the combination from you.

836
01:19:20,025 --> 01:19:21,568
I'm sorry.

837
01:19:30,953 --> 01:19:31,996
Go.

838
01:19:33,122 --> 01:19:34,790
Get out of here.

839
01:19:40,963 --> 01:19:42,589
Mind explaining yourself, rookie?

840
01:19:42,673 --> 01:19:45,926
Abetting a felon is not just a
fail offense. It's a crime.

841
01:19:46,010 --> 01:19:49,763
I already picked up the fail
when I lost my primary weapon.

842
01:19:49,847 --> 01:19:50,931
I'm not gonna be a Judge,

843
01:19:51,015 --> 01:19:53,475
and I don't need to be
a mind-reader to know it.

844
01:19:53,600 --> 01:19:54,768
He's a victim, not a perp.

845
01:19:54,852 --> 01:19:56,603
And until my assessment is formally over,

846
01:19:56,687 --> 01:19:58,772
I'm still entitled to dispense justice.

847
01:19:58,856 --> 01:20:00,691
And that's what I just
did by letting him go.

848
01:20:02,443 --> 01:20:05,112
Maybe that'll be
the one difference I do make.

849
01:20:05,195 --> 01:20:09,116
The code to Ma-Ma's chambers is 4-9-4-3-6.

850
01:20:09,199 --> 01:20:10,534
Let's finish this.

851
01:21:39,581 --> 01:21:41,208
You're a piece of work, Dredd.

852
01:21:44,086 --> 01:21:45,796
But then so am I.

853
01:21:46,964 --> 01:21:48,882
You think I didn't know
I'd get busted some day?

854
01:21:48,966 --> 01:21:50,592
Goes with the territory.

855
01:21:51,802 --> 01:21:55,639
This entire level is rigged
with enough high explosives

856
01:21:55,722 --> 01:21:57,724
to take out the top 50 stories.

857
01:21:59,059 --> 01:22:01,728
If they go, the rest go, too.

858
01:22:05,899 --> 01:22:07,151
Like the jewelry?

859
01:22:10,279 --> 01:22:12,656
It's a transmitter synched
to my heart beat.

860
01:22:13,991 --> 01:22:15,993
My heart stops beating,

861
01:22:16,952 --> 01:22:21,165
the building blows. Everyone in it, ash.

862
01:22:25,502 --> 01:22:27,045
You got no way out, Judge.

863
01:22:30,007 --> 01:22:31,508
Put your gun down.

864
01:22:33,760 --> 01:22:37,181
Do you know
how many people live in this block?

865
01:22:37,848 --> 01:22:42,352
This isn't a negotiation.
The sentence is death.

866
01:22:43,854 --> 01:22:45,689
You can't afford to take the risk.

867
01:23:24,228 --> 01:23:25,979
We're a kilometer above ground.

868
01:23:27,397 --> 01:23:30,067
What do you figure
the range is on that thing?

869
01:23:31,485 --> 01:23:33,487
Could it get through 100
levels of concrete?

870
01:23:34,905 --> 01:23:36,532
How about 200?

871
01:23:37,574 --> 01:23:39,243
Let's find out.

872
01:23:53,674 --> 01:23:57,636
Citizen Ma-Ma.
Your crimes are multiple homicide

873
01:23:57,719 --> 01:24:00,597
and the manufacture
and distribution of narcotics.

874
01:24:01,056 --> 01:24:02,432
How do you plead?

875
01:24:09,565 --> 01:24:10,816
Defense noted.

876
01:26:37,045 --> 01:26:38,088
Yeah!

877
01:27:36,229 --> 01:27:37,355
Anderson.

878
01:27:38,648 --> 01:27:39,733
Victims first.

879
01:27:39,816 --> 01:27:42,110
Let the perps lay where they lie, huh?

880
01:27:44,404 --> 01:27:45,906
Your assessment's now over.

881
01:28:02,005 --> 01:28:03,006
Sir.

882
01:28:09,638 --> 01:28:11,598
When I heard you'd called in a 10-24,

883
01:28:11,681 --> 01:28:13,266
I thought I'd better check it out.

884
01:28:13,350 --> 01:28:15,268
Seeing as I forced the rookie on you.

885
01:28:15,936 --> 01:28:17,854
So, what happened in there?

886
01:28:17,938 --> 01:28:19,272
Drug bust.

887
01:28:19,356 --> 01:28:21,274
Look like you been through it.

888
01:28:21,358 --> 01:28:22,984
Perps were uncooperative.

889
01:28:24,027 --> 01:28:25,445
So how did she do?

890
01:28:26,696 --> 01:28:28,865
She a pass or a fail?

891
01:28:32,285 --> 01:28:33,829
Let's take a look, huh?

892
01:28:34,663 --> 01:28:36,331
She's a pass.

893
01:28:37,624 --> 01:28:39,084
I knew she would be.

894
01:28:44,297 --> 01:28:45,882
No time to waste. Let's move.

895
01:28:45,966 --> 01:28:47,133
Tell them to go to the back

896
01:28:47,217 --> 01:28:49,094
and we will take the front entrance.

897
01:28:57,853 --> 01:28:59,688
<i>Mega City One.</i>

898
01:29:01,147 --> 01:29:02,399
<i>800 million people</i>

899
01:29:02,482 --> 01:29:05,277
<i>living in the ruin of the old world</i>

900
01:29:05,360 --> 01:29:07,821
<i>and the mega structures of the new one.</i>

901
01:29:09,906 --> 01:29:13,535
<i>Only one thing
fighting for order in the chaos,</i>

902
01:29:15,078 --> 01:29:16,413
<i>Judges.</i>

